WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.072 --> 00:00:04.401
Today’s 1 Minute Monday is

00:00:04.821 --> 00:00:05.756
support someone!

00:00:06.144 --> 00:00:07.683
Find someone in your network

00:00:07.683 --> 00:00:09.222
who you can help today.

00:00:09.715 --> 00:00:11.036
So here’s a quick story;

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:12.824
I work with an agent

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:14.686
and this guy represents

00:00:14.772 --> 00:00:15.976
a whole bunch of thought leaders

00:00:15.976 --> 00:00:17.252
and a lot of them are trying to make videos.

00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:19.092
And he brought in a new client

00:00:19.173 --> 00:00:20.931
and I checked out on of her videos

00:00:21.064 --> 00:00:23.070
and she’s just getting started but I liked video

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.237
and so I gave it a thumbs-up on YouTube

00:00:25.323 --> 00:00:28.407
and left a comment on it saying that I liked it.

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:30.824
And I did that because I remember

00:00:30.824 --> 00:00:32.021
when I was first getting started

00:00:32.494 --> 00:00:34.488
and nobody left any comments

00:00:34.925 --> 00:00:36.286
and I was barely getting any views.

00:00:36.782 --> 00:00:39.012
And I felt like I was pouring my heat into something

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:40.770
and nobody cared about it.

00:00:41.095 --> 00:00:43.020
And she’s in that same spot now where

00:00:43.248 --> 00:00:44.114
you know, not getting

00:00:44.114 --> 00:00:45.420
a lot on comments on the videos

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.508
not getting a lot of views

00:00:46.941 --> 00:00:48.201
and I remember when I got a comment

00:00:48.494 --> 00:00:49.657
I felt so good like

00:00:49.657 --> 00:00:51.474
“Yes! Somebody cares!”

00:00:51.982 --> 00:00:55.434
And so today I got to be that somebody for her

00:00:55.741 --> 00:00:57.100
and give her a little bit more energy

00:00:57.308 --> 00:00:58.357
and motivation and a boost.

00:00:58.695 --> 00:01:00.487
So support the people in your network.

00:01:00.714 --> 00:01:01.618
It’ll make you feel good

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.507
it’ll make them feel good

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:06.397
and it will help your business as well.

00:01:06.822 --> 00:01:07.658
Believe.

